{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13111100","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13111100","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1311110001:1":{"text":"柳博米尔——就是我那位朋友——他独自住在这片黑沼森林中，很少见人，也不爱参与外界的事情。","source_cn":"柳博米尔——就是我那位朋友——他独自住在这片黑沼森林中...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1BD88EF22235120","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311110002:1":{"text":"那……我们能见到他吗？要是他不愿意见我们该怎么办？","source_cn":"那……我们能见到他吗？要是他不愿意见我们该怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6D7B42835D3626A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311110003:1":{"text":"不必担心，我会给他带上一份礼物。","source_cn":"不必担心，我会给他带上一份礼物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x609EA3420FC8BE53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1311110003":{"text":"不必担心，我会给他带上一份礼物。","source_cn":"不必担心，我会给他带上一份礼物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x609EA3420FC8BE53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311110004:1":{"text":"相信我，我知道有一样东西，他是绝对无法拒绝的。","source_cn":"相信我，我知道有一样东西，他是绝对无法拒绝的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA74B28D24D35FA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"